/// H-33's verdict on each network, `[seed 23, seed 24]`, by the rule committed first, over the
/// pinned tables. Clause 0 held on both: every rule gave a value and the frozen block passed both
/// measures, the stimulus seen in 64 trials of 64 on each. Clause 1 held in every mapping of both
/// arms on both: 126, 124, 124 and 123 of each mapping's last 128 trials from the assignment on
/// seed 23 and 122, 115, 118 and 126 from the mirrored assignment; 117, 123, 120 and 115, and 124,
/// 120, 121 and 123, on seed 24. Clause 2: no coupling past 1.30 of its image's, the highest 1.183
/// on seed 23 and 1.195 on seed 24. Clause 3: every reversal within 23 blocks, in 15, 13 and 13
/// and in 16, 14 and 12 on seed 23, in 21, 12 and 15 and in 17, 16 and 14 on seed 24. Clause 4: the
/// network outside the couplings within two parts in ten thousand of the image's at every block's
/// end. H-33 is yes; ADR-0165 wrote no prediction for it.
const SEEDED_1024: [Seeded; 2] = [Seeded {
    derived: true,
    arms: Some(Drawn {
        learning: Scheduled {
            learned: [[true; 4]; 2],
            bounded: [true; 2],
            over: [None; 2],
            yes: true,
        },
        revised: [[true; 3]; 2],
        left: [None; 2],
        held: [true; 2],
        yes: true,
    }),
    yes: true,
}; 2];

/// The step of ADR-0165's stopping rule the verdict reaches (`seeded_step`): 3, yes on both
/// networks. The learning configuration is the rules', not one network's.
const SEEDED_STEP_1024: u8 = 3;

