/// image's, the highest 1.169 on seed 22 and 1.151 on seed 23. Clause 3: every reversal within 23
/// blocks, in 15, 15 and 10 and in 13, 13 and 12 on seed 22, in 13, 9 and 12 and in 14, 12 and 14
/// on seed 23. Clause 4: the network outside the couplings within two parts in ten thousand of
/// the image's at every block's end. H-34 is yes; ADR-0168 wrote no prediction for it.
